.TH RESOURCES 1 "13 August 2026" "Resources 1.8.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
resources \- inspect system resource usage and running processes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B resources
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Resources
is a GTK system monitor for viewing processor, memory, storage, network,
graphics, application, and process activity.
.PP
Gnozzard installs Resources as its system-monitor application and adds
a launcher to the GNOME top panel.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the installed Resources version and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gnome-system-monitor (1)
